1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:06,840
This is the story of a band of brave heroes, whom fate once united.

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:10,740
Bjarni, a proud viking and the discoverer of a new world.

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,380
Cyra, a fair princess of the Orient.

4
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:17,380
Sigurd, a hero from the Frankish Empire.

5
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,720
And Hatschi, the brave Starrus.

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:23,720
Together they have already survived many fights and adventures.

7
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:29,800
But now the world was threatened by a menace so great, it could shake even the realm of the gods.
